# Environment for the realtime Worker ONLY (src/worker).
#
# Keep this separate from .env.local. Wrangler loads env files and uploads their
# values as Worker secrets on deploy, and the realtime layer must never hold the
# database URL or the better-auth secret — it authenticates with signed tickets and
# talks to no database at all.
#
# Must match the value the Next app mints tickets with.
GAME_TICKET_SECRET=replace-me-with-a-long-random-value
